<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-ruptus</span></b> , a, um,
			Part. [derumpo, not in use], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>broken;</i> hence, like abruptus, of
			localities, <i>precipitous, steep</i> (not before
			Lucret.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextra pars (maceriae) in aliquantum
					altitudinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					42, 15</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saxa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 539</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ripae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					37, 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">angustiae (with praecipites),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collis (with arduus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					2, 80</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spatia terrae (with prona),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					7, 2, 11</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in deruptiorem tumulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					38, 2</span></i>
			.—<i>Sup.</i> and adv.
			appear not to occur.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> In <i>plur. subst.</i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dērupta</span></b> ,
			ōrum, n., <i>precipices</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in derupta praecipitati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					38, 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per derupta et avia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					4, 45</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">6, 21</span></i>. </div>
